      "message": "Having the data structure store the last query doesn\u0027t feel quite right -- it feels like the calling class should track that. Why not have findRect() return the LocationRecord? That said, I\u0027m also concerned about inadvertently doing two queries in a row before trying to insert -- which *would* be an argument for keeping the last query. Then you could return false or some other error code from findRect() if there\u0027s already a LocationRecord stored. WDYT?",
