      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T15:43:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems like the right balance to me as well. I proposed asserting that findRect9) and insertFoundRect() are called in the expected pattern (given the docs say they *must* be called a certain way).\n\nDown the line, I could also see having a `discardQuery` or similar to reset `fLastFound` in the event you did the query but don\u0027t actually want to insert with a follow-up `findRect`. Right now we don\u0027t need that though.",
